    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/apartment-31-waterside-quay-cork-city-cork-t12-ve20\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present Apartment 31 Waterside Quay, Cork City in Cork.\r\n\r\nApartment 31 Waterside Quay is a characterful three-bedroom apartment situated within a converted former ironworks building on Hanover Street in Cork City. The building retains a distinctive brick façade, arched entrance and large industrial-style windows that reflect its original use. Internally, high ceilings, exposed timber beams and wood flooring add warmth and individuality to the accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, a central hallway leads to the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. This well-proportioned space benefits from tall windows that provide natural light and an outlook over the internal courtyard. The living area offers flexibility for both seating and dining, while a freestanding stove-style heater provides an additional focal point.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is arranged neatly to one side and includes fitted cabinetry, generous worktop space and a practical breakfast counter. A washing machine is incorporated within the kitchen, keeping everyday laundry needs conveniently accommodated within the main living space.\r\n\r\nThree bedrooms are positioned off the hallway, comprising a larger principal bedroom and two additional rooms suitable for bedroom, guest accommodation or home-office use. The high ceilings and exposed beams continue into the bedrooms, while the tall windows reinforce the building’s industrial character. The bathroom is centrally located and includes a bath with an overhead shower, wash-hand basin and WC.\r\n\r\nLocated on Hanover Street, the development is within convenient reach of Cork city centre and its wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities. Public transport options are also available nearby, providing connections throughout Cork City and the surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nThis apartment offers an opportunity to acquire a well-arranged city apartment within a building of genuine industrial character. Its three-bedroom layout, central location and distinctive original features make it an appealing choice for purchasers seeking practical accommodation with a sense of individuality."
      },
